      <groundspeak:country>United States</groundspeak:country>
      <groundspeak:state>Oregon</groundspeak:state>
      <groundspeak:short_description html="False">Beware, muggles may be in the area. It can be reached from the sidewalk, but may be out of reach for a wheelchair or small child at sidewalk level. Owner is aware of geocache, so feel free to step on the property to search. Muggles may question you. NOTE: The "No Trespassing" sign does not apply to geocachers.</groundspeak:short_description>
      <groundspeak:long_description html="False">Bring your own pen.</groundspeak:long_description>
      <groundspeak:encoded_hints>Woodn't you want to know.</groundspeak:encoded_hints>
