          <groundspeak:finder id="">CGinOR</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="False">Met the CO’s mom while on the hunt. Had a very nice chat. Fairly quick find with hint. Thanks for adding to my fun today.</groundspeak:text>
