          <groundspeak:text encoded="False">Driving around looking for a self-service vacuum, and stopped for some caches &amp;quot;along the way.&amp;quot; This one was a nice front-yard, after I moved on from the wrong item, it was a quick find. Thanks!</groundspeak:text>
